flowchart TD
    %% Main Privacy Policy Page
    A[Super Administrator Dashboard] --> B[Privacy Policy Page]
    
    %% Main Navigation Elements
    B --> C{Interactive Side Menu}
    B --> D[Search Box]
    B --> E[Expandable Sections]
    B --> F[Quick Access Buttons]
    B --> G[Update Notifications]


    %% Interactive Side Menu Options
    C --> C1[Overview/Introduction]
